  "details": "<p>The shrine discovered in 1889 in the\u00a0<em>Horti Caesaris\u00a0</em>near the Trastevere train station has been linked with Hercules Cubans. There are two Latin inscriptions (<span><em>CIL</em> 6, 30891, 30892) that\u00a0</span>record\u00a0a dedication made by a L. Domitius Permissus.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
